{"id":"8e41fc628b847852","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-undirected-connectivity.md","title":"无向连通性语言 UPATH","display":"df-undirected-connectivity — 无向连通性语言 UPATH","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-undirected-connectivity","aliases":["28-df-undirected-connectivity"],"display":"df-undirected-connectivity — 无向连通性语言 UPATH","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"§21.4; Theorem 21.21","source_printed_pages":"440","source_pdf_pages":"466","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-undirected-connectivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-undirected-connectivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-undirected-connectivity — 无向连通性语言 UPATH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.4; Theorem 21.21"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"440"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"466"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}\">\\(A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in[n]\">\\(s,t\\in[n]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 为自然数的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>；字串相邻表示连接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U},\\operatorname{matword}_n,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm U}\">\\(\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U},\\operatorname{matword}_n,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm U}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UPATH}\">\\(\\operatorname{UPATH}\\)</span> 由下式定义；自环允许。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{matword}_n(A)\\in\\Sigma^{n^2},\\qquad\\operatorname{matword}_n(A)_{(i-1)n+j}\\coloneqq A_{i,j}\\qquad(i,j\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{matword}_n(A)\\in\\Sigma^{n^2},\\qquad\\operatorname{matword}_n(A)_{(i-1)n+j}\\coloneqq A_{i,j}\\qquad(i,j\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm U}(n,A,s,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(n)\\operatorname{matword}_n(A)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(s)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm U}(n,A,s,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(n)\\operatorname{matword}_n(A)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(s)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UPATH}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm U}(n,A,s,t):n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1},\\ A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n},\\ s,t\\in[n],\\ A=A^{\\mathsf T},\\ \\exists\\ell\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_\\ell)\\in[n]^{\\ell+1}\\;\\left(v_0=s\\land v_\\ell=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\;A_{v_i,v_{i+1}}=1\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UPATH}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm U}(n,A,s,t):n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1},\\ A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n},\\ s,t\\in[n],\\ A=A^{\\mathsf T},\\ \\exists\\ell\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_\\ell)\\in[n]^{\\ell+1}\\;\\left(v_0=s\\land v_\\ell=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\;A_{v_i,v_{i+1}}=1\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把原书无向 s–t 连通性在本书内建为简单的矩阵编码；s=t 用零步路径。若存在更长连通路径，可删除重复顶点的片段得到至多 n−1 步路径。重边不会改变可达性，故矩阵编码与第21章多重图算法的判定任务兼容。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§21.4; Theorem 21.21；印刷页 440；PDF 页 466。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U},\\operatorname{matword}_n,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UPATH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{matword}_n(A)\\in\\Sigma^{n^2},\\qquad\\operatorname{matword}_n(A)_{(i-1)n+j}\\coloneqq A_{i,j}\\qquad(i,j\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm U}(n,A,s,t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(n)\\operatorname{matword}_n(A)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(s)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm U}(t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UPATH}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm U}(n,A,s,t):n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1},\\ A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n},\\ s,t\\in[n],\\ A=A^{\\mathsf T},\\ \\exists\\ell\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_\\ell)\\in[n]^{\\ell+1}\\;\\left(v_0=s\\land v_\\ell=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}\\;A_{v_i,v_{i+1}}=1\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2185,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-392","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-power]]、[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]、[[28-df-replacement-product]]、[[28-thm-tensor-product-expansion]]、[[28-thm-replacement-product-expansion]]、[[28-df-flat-source]]、[[28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition]]、[[28-df-branching-program]]、[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]、[[28-thm-reingold]]、[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]、[[28-thm-nisan-space-prg]]。"},{"id":"05f4c5c9288daa5c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UPATH}$ 见 [[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]；$\\mathbf L$ 为只计工作带空间的确定型对数空间类，见 [[28-df-l]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}